          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Irrigation request requirements",
          "items": [
            "Field, zone, crop stage, and requested timing are stated",
            "Soil, plant, weather, or schedule basis is attached",
            "Requested duration, depth, volume, or target reference is stated",
            "Water source and allocation availability are routed",
            "Pump, pressure, flow, and zone capacity are considered",
            "Downstream conflicts, access, and worker timing are identified",
            "Injection or water-quality review is routed if applicable",
            "Completion reading and result handoff are defined"
          ]
